      <Description>k__BackingField: 'Xamarin support for gRPC C#. Note that the gRPC
        C# support for the Xamarin platform is considered experimental.


        This
        package contains the native grpc_csharp_ext libraries that are needed to
        run gRPC C# on mobile platforms (Android, iOS).

        WARNING: Versions
        of Grpc.Core.Xamarin and Grpc.Core dependencies being used in your project
        must always match exactly, otherwise things will be badly broken.


        Note
        that the Grpc.Core implementation of gRPC for C# is in maintenance mode and
        will be replaced by grpc-dotnet in the future.

        See https://grpc.io/blog/grpc-csharp-future/
        for details.'
